The '''Skangravi-Mestun Regional Hyperlane''' was a [[hyperspace route]] that was located close to [[Pandem Nai]]. While the [[New Republic]] was preparing to launch an [[Battle of Pandem Nai|attack]] on the [[planet]] to free it from [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] control, they managed to successfully secure enough [[star system]]s to take the Skangravi-Mestun.<ref name="Alphabet Squadron">[[Alphabet Squadron (novel)|''Alphabet Squadron'']]</ref>

